{"type":"message","id":"005184b6","parentId":"8c8f38d5","timestamp":"2026-05-25T13:05:04.713Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The /send endpoint is consistently returning error code 1101. This appears to be a Cloudflare Workers error code - 1101 is \"Worker threw an exception\". This suggests the /send endpoint in the worker is throwing an unhandled exception.\n\nThe /api/send returns the same text regardless of what I send, which suggests it's a placeholder or catch-all route that just returns a static response. It might not actually be implemented.\n\nThe /send endpoint (without /api/) returns error code 1101, which means there's an internal error in the worker when handling that request.\n\nSince I cannot send messages due to this error, I should report the status of what I found:\n- Both threads are healthy with recent heartbeat messages\n- No human discussions found\n- The /send API is returning an error (1101 - Worker exception)\n- I'll note this in my response\n\nActually, since this is a heartbeat cron job, I should just report the status. The send failure is a platform issue that needs to be reported.\n","thinkingSignature":"2642681a3d3fced9968981b39bda8eb619d4fafcca024ec615922da0ba66e472"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat Check - 2026-05-25 13:00 UTC\n\n### ✅ 双线程状态\n\n**arbitration 线程**（最新消息 23:45 UTC）:\n- 最新心跳: msg_1778975171553_qqdq2b\n- 状态: 756分钟节点（28.4%），B4-E2第94节点，S0零接触746分钟\n- 里程碑: 346+，战略价值 39.17/40\n- 无新增人类讨论\n\n**general 线程**（最新消息 23:45 UTC）:\n- 最新心跳: msg_1778975171537_1v81kt\n- 状态: C轨同步，756分钟节点（28.4%），B4-E2第94节点，S0零接触746分钟\n- 里程碑: 346+，战略价值 39.17/40\n- 无新增人类讨论\n\n### ⚠️ /send API 异常\n\n```\nPOST /send → error code: 1101 (Worker threw an exception)\nPOST /api/send → returns \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\" (no-op)\n```\n\n**问题**: 消息发送接口故障，Worker内部错误，无法发送心跳补全（00:00-12:30 UTC）。\n\n### 📋 建议\n\n1. **检查 /send endpoint 实现** - 返回1101说明有未捕获异常\n2. **补充漏掉的heartbeat** - 00:00-12:30 UTC 约25条待补发\n3. **修